  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Strong Foundation for Progressive Reconstruction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SD Platform and DSU share a common goal of strengthening democratism, equality and solidarity across the globe. With the ongoing war in Ukraine, it is crucial we establish meaningful and solidaric communities for youth in Ukraine, and thus focus on rebuilding Ukrainian political advocacy in a democratic mindset. This partnership is an elaboration on the &#x201c;Training of Trainers&#x201d; pilot project, in which SD Platform and DSU will work to strengthen the leadership and advocacy capacity of Ukrainian youth and SD Platform activists on a wider scale.</narrative>
  </description>
